    <div begin="00:04.260" end="03:14.410">
      <p begin="00:04.260" end="00:04.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:04.260" end="00:04.700">はぁ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哈啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哈啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Haa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Haa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Haa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Haa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Haa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ха-а</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Haa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Haa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:15.920" end="00:18.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:15.920" end="00:16.570">ああ</span><span begin="00:16.570" end="00:16.600">、</span><span begin="00:16.990" end="00:17.060">ま</span><span begin="00:17.150" end="00:17.380">た</span><span begin="00:17.470" end="00:17.750">そ</span><span begin="00:17.860" end="00:18.220">れ</span><span begin="00:18.220" end="00:18.360">で</span><span begin="00:18.360" end="00:18.460">す</span><span begin="00:18.560" end="00:18.700">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 又来这一套吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊啊 又來這一套嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah, is it this again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또 그 소리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah c'est encore ça n'est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez con eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah schon wieder diese Masche?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah de novo com essa história</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах опять всё то же самое</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, mata sore desu ka</span></p>
      <p begin="00:18.750" end="00:21.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:18.750" end="00:18.830">わ</span><span begin="00:18.920" end="00:19.080">か</span><span begin="00:19.080" end="00:19.280">っ</span><span begin="00:19.280" end="00:19.350">た</span><span begin="00:19.460" end="00:19.830">つ</span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:20.000">も</span><span begin="00:20.000" end="00:20.210">り</span><span begin="00:20.340" end="00:20.570">で</span><span begin="00:20.650" end="00:20.760">す</span><span begin="00:20.870" end="00:21.260">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真以为自己什么都懂吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真以為自己什麼都懂嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Do you think you understand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다 안다는 척이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vous croyez avoir tout compris n'est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Crees que lo entiendes todo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denkst du du hast alles verstanden?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você acha que entendeu tudo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Думаете что всё поняли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Pensi di aver capito tutto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatta tsumori desu ka</span></p>
      <p begin="00:21.560" end="00:24.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:21.560" end="00:22.300">あ</span><span begin="00:22.300" end="00:22.480">あ</span><span begin="00:22.480" end="00:22.510">、</span><span begin="00:22.630" end="00:22.850">踏</span><span begin="00:22.850" end="00:23.050">み</span><span begin="00:23.150" end="00:23.340">込</span><span begin="00:23.340" end="00:23.500">ん</span><span begin="00:23.500" end="00:23.770">じゃ</span><span begin="00:23.770" end="00:23.880">っ</span><span begin="00:23.880" end="00:24.070">た</span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.220">の</span><span begin="00:24.220" end="00:24.310">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 还是踩进来了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊啊 還是踩進來了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah, so you stepped right in didn't you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 기어코 선을 넘었네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah vous avez fini par mettre les pieds dedans</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah ya te has metido de lleno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah da bist du wohl reingetreten was?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah então você pisou fundo não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах вы уже шагнули туда да</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah ti sei spinto troppo oltre</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, fumikonjatta no ne</span></p>
      <p begin="00:24.400" end="00:25.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:24.400" end="00:24.590">ウェ</span><span begin="00:24.590" end="00:24.670">ル</span><span begin="00:24.760" end="00:24.970">カ</span><span begin="00:24.970" end="00:25.020">ム</span><span begin="00:25.110" end="00:25.280">地</span><span begin="00:25.280" end="00:25.530">雷</span><span begin="00:25.640" end="00:25.990">原</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢迎来到地雷阵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">歡迎來到地雷陣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Welcome to the minefield</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지뢰밭에 온 걸 환영해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Bienvenue dans le champ de mines</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Bienvenido al campo de minas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Willkommen im Minenfeld</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Bem-vindo ao campo minado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Добро пожаловать на минное поле</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Benvenuto nel campo minato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Werukamu jiraigen</span></p>
      <p begin="00:26.690" end="00:28.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.690" end="00:26.780">て</span><span begin="00:26.860" end="00:26.940">て</span><span begin="00:27.040" end="00:27.120">て</span><span begin="00:27.220" end="00:27.580">点</span><span begin="00:27.580" end="00:27.850">呼</span> <span begin="00:28.280" end="00:28.540">どう</span><span begin="00:28.640" end="00:28.880">ぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点 点 点 点名 请吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">點 點 點 點名 請吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ro-ro-roll call go ahead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">점점점점호 시작</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">A-a-a-appel allez-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">P p pasando lista adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Z-z-z-zählen bitte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">T-t-t-tchamada respondam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">П-п-п-перекличка начинайте</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Appello appello forza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Te te te tenko douzo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:29.140" end="00:31.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:29.140" end="00:29.250">て</span><span begin="00:29.330" end="00:29.410">て</span><span begin="00:29.510" end="00:29.580">て</span><span begin="00:29.680" end="00:29.850">て</span><span begin="00:29.850" end="00:29.940">ア</span><span begin="00:30.040" end="00:30.380">テン</span><span begin="00:30.380" end="00:30.670">ション</span> <span begin="00:31.040" end="00:31.300">も</span><span begin="00:31.300" end="00:31.460">っ</span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:31.740">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">注 注 注 注意 给我多点关注</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">注 注 注 注意 給我多點關注</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A-a-a-attention more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">집집집집중 조금 더</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">A-a-a-attention encore plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A a a atención un poco más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">A-a-a-aufgepasst noch mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A-a-a-atenção mais ainda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В-в-в-внимание побольше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Massima attenzione di più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Te te te te atenshon motto</span></p>
      <p begin="00:31.990" end="00:35.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:31.990" end="00:32.510">僕</span><span begin="00:32.510" end="00:32.620">ら</span><span begin="00:32.620" end="00:32.800">を</span><span begin="00:32.880" end="00:33.170">目</span><span begin="00:33.380" end="00:33.540">の</span><span begin="00:33.540" end="00:34.310">敵</span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.640">に</span><span begin="00:34.760" end="00:35.150">す</span><span begin="00:35.150" end="00:35.330">る</span><span begin="00:35.330" end="00:35.500">な</span><span begin="00:35.500" end="00:35.570">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然要把我们视作眼中钉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然要把我們視作眼中釘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you are going to treat us as enemies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리를 눈엣가시로 여긴다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si vous vous obstinez à nous prendre pour cible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si nos vas a tratar como enemigos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ihr uns zum Feindbild macht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se vocês vão nos tratar como inimigas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Раз уж вы так ополчились на нас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se ci prendete come nemici</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bokura o menokataki ni suru nara</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.630" end="00:38.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:35.630" end="00:35.760">そ</span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:35.860">ん</span><span begin="00:35.860" end="00:35.930">な</span><span begin="00:35.930" end="00:36.020">ら</span><span begin="00:36.020" end="00:36.100">こ</span><span begin="00:36.100" end="00:36.200">っ</span><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.290">ち</span><span begin="00:36.290" end="00:36.380">も</span><span begin="00:36.380" end="00:36.550">容</span><span begin="00:36.550" end="00:36.680">赦</span><span begin="00:36.890" end="00:37.060">は</span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.380">し</span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.750">な</span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:38.080">い</span><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:38.660">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那这边也绝不会手下留情哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那這邊也絕不會手下留情哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then we won't show any mercy either</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇다면 우리도 봐주지 않겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors nous ne ferons pas de quartier non plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entonces nosotros tampoco tendremos piedad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dann werden wir auch keine Gnade zeigen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então nós também não teremos piedade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То и мы не проявим пощады</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Allora non avremo pietà neanche noi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sonnara kotchi mo yousha wa shinai ze</span></p>
      <p begin="00:39.170" end="00:42.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:39.170" end="00:39.610">学</span><span begin="00:39.610" end="00:39.970">園</span><span begin="00:40.270" end="00:40.640">戦</span><span begin="00:40.640" end="00:41.060">線</span> <span begin="00:41.330" end="00:41.620">は</span><span begin="00:41.710" end="00:41.920">み</span><span begin="00:42.040" end="00:42.280">出</span><span begin="00:42.390" end="00:42.840">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">学园战线 突破界限吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">學園戰線 突破界限吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">School wars step out of line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">학원전선 한계를 벗어나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Front scolaire dépassez les limites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Frente escolar rompe los límites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schulfront sprengt die Grenzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Frente de batalha escolar ultrapasse os limites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Школьный фронт прорывай границы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fronte scolastico usciamo fuori dagli schemi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Gakuen sensen hamidase</span></p>
      <p begin="00:43.380" end="00:44.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:43.410">“</span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:43.760">じゃあ</span><span begin="00:43.870" end="00:44.200">ね</span><span begin="00:44.200" end="00:44.230">”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜拜啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">拜拜啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">"See ya"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">"그럼 이만"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">« À plus tard »</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos vemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">"Also dann Tschüss"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">«Até mais»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ну пока</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">«Addio»</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">"Jaa ne"</span></p>
      <p begin="00:44.690" end="00:49.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:44.690" end="00:45.040">僕</span><span begin="00:45.040" end="00:45.140">ら</span><span begin="00:45.220" end="00:45.310">し</span><span begin="00:45.400" end="00:45.460">か</span><span begin="00:45.560" end="00:45.740">知</span><span begin="00:45.740" end="00:45.920">ら</span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.070">な</span><span begin="00:46.070" end="00:46.200">い</span><span begin="00:46.280" end="00:47.570">世</span><span begin="00:47.690" end="00:49.110">界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我们知晓的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只有我們知曉的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A world known only to us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리밖에 모르는 세상</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un monde que nous seuls connaissons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un mundo que solo nosotros conocemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Welt die nur wir kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O mundo que só nós conhecemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мир о котором знаем лишь мы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un mondo che solo noi conosciamo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bokura shika shiranai sekai</span></p>
      <p begin="00:50.510" end="00:51.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:50.510" end="00:50.570">無</span><span begin="00:50.690" end="00:51.040">敵</span><span begin="00:51.040" end="00:51.100">の</span><span begin="00:51.180" end="00:51.540">シー</span><span begin="00:51.540" end="00:51.600">ク</span><span begin="00:51.600" end="00:51.780">レ</span><span begin="00:51.780" end="00:51.860">ッ</span><span begin="00:51.860" end="00:51.890">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无敌的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無敵的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">An invincible secret</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무적의 비밀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un secret invincible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un secreto invencible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein unbesiegbares Geheimnis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um segredo invencível</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Непобедимый секрет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un segreto invincibile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Muteki no shiikuretto</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.890" end="00:54.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:51.890" end="00:52.050">こ</span><span begin="00:52.050" end="00:52.190">ん</span><span begin="00:52.190" end="00:52.450">が</span><span begin="00:52.450" end="00:52.610">ら</span><span begin="00:52.610" end="00:52.830">が</span><span begin="00:52.830" end="00:52.910">っ</span><span begin="00:52.910" end="00:53.160">た</span><span begin="00:53.160" end="00:53.240">ま</span><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.580">ま</span><span begin="00:53.680" end="00:53.910">で</span><span begin="00:53.910" end="00:53.960">い</span><span begin="00:54.040" end="00:54.390">こう</span><span begin="00:54.390" end="00:54.650">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样保持着一团糟继续前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣保持著一團糟繼續前進吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's just go while staying all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엉망진창인 채로 나아가자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avançons même en restant tout emmêlés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigamos adelante así todos enredados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einfach so völlig verheddert weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos continuar assim todas emaranhadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай продолжим прямо в этой путанице</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andiamo avanti anche se siamo tutti aggrovigliati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kongaragatta mama de ikou ze</span></p>
      <p begin="00:54.920" end="00:57.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:54.920" end="00:55.280">思</span><span begin="00:55.280" end="00:55.350">い</span><span begin="00:55.430" end="00:55.620">込</span><span begin="00:55.620" end="00:55.780">み</span><span begin="00:55.780" end="00:55.990">さ</span><span begin="00:55.990" end="00:56.160">え</span><span begin="00:56.160" end="00:56.460">も</span><span begin="00:56.460" end="00:56.870">才</span><span begin="00:56.870" end="00:57.160">能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连一厢情愿也是种天赋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連一廂情願也是種天賦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even having fixed ideas is a talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멋대로 믿는 것조차 재능이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même nos convictions aveugles sont un talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso creer ciegamente es un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar reine Einbildung ist ein Talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até mesmo criar ilusões é um talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже слепая вера это талант</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persino le nostre fisse sono un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omoikomi sae mo sainou</span></p>
      <p begin="00:57.390" end="00:59.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:57.390" end="00:57.460">理</span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:57.740">解</span><span begin="00:57.740" end="00:57.840">っ</span><span begin="00:57.840" end="00:58.100">て</span><span begin="00:58.100" end="00:58.270">も</span><span begin="00:58.270" end="00:58.410">ら</span><span begin="00:58.410" end="00:58.550">え</span><span begin="00:58.550" end="00:58.700">な</span><span begin="00:58.700" end="00:58.810">い</span><span begin="00:58.810" end="00:58.970">な</span><span begin="00:58.970" end="00:59.340">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然無法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they won't understand us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해받지 못한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S'ils ne peuvent pas nous comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no pueden entendernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie uns schon nicht verstehen wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eles não conseguem nos entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если они не хотят нас понимать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non riusciamo a farci capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatte moraenai nara</span></p>
      <p begin="00:59.520" end="01:02.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:59.520" end="00:59.590">ひ</span><span begin="00:59.690" end="00:59.760">た</span><span begin="00:59.840" end="01:00.050">す</span><span begin="01:00.050" end="01:00.230">ら</span><span begin="01:00.230" end="01:00.400">に</span><span begin="01:00.400" end="01:00.680">挑</span><span begin="01:00.680" end="01:00.760">ん</span><span begin="01:00.760" end="01:00.830">で</span><span begin="01:00.830" end="01:00.930">ゆ</span><span begin="01:00.930" end="01:01.110">く</span><span begin="01:01.110" end="01:01.450">物</span><span begin="01:01.450" end="01:02.150">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就演绎一场不断发起挑战的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就演繹一場不斷發起挑戰的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story of relentlessly taking on challenges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 끝없이 부딪혀가는 이야기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C'est l'histoire d'un défi que nous relèverons sans relâche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es una historia de desafiar constantemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Geschichte die einfach unerbittlich herausfordert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então esta é uma história onde apenas continuamos desafiando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это история нашего неустанного вызова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una storia in cui continueremo a sfidare tutto ciecamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitasura ni idonde yuku monogatari</span></p>
      <p begin="01:02.470" end="01:03.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:02.470" end="01:02.590">見</span><span begin="01:02.590" end="01:02.800">せ</span><span begin="01:02.800" end="01:02.870">つ</span><span begin="01:02.870" end="01:02.980">け</span><span begin="01:03.060" end="01:03.130">て</span><span begin="01:03.210" end="01:03.540">こ</span><span begin="01:03.540" end="01:03.570">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p>
      <p begin="01:03.590" end="01:06.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:03.590" end="01:03.930">ラ</span><span begin="01:03.930" end="01:04.290">ラ</span><span begin="01:04.290" end="01:04.660">ラ</span><span begin="01:04.660" end="01:05.010">ラ</span><span begin="01:05.010" end="01:05.350">ラ</span><span begin="01:05.350" end="01:05.720">ラ</span><span begin="01:05.720" end="01:06.000">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:06.000" end="01:08.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:06.000" end="01:06.230">こ</span><span begin="01:06.230" end="01:06.310">ん</span><span begin="01:06.310" end="01:06.410">な</span><span begin="01:06.410" end="01:06.620">僕</span><span begin="01:06.620" end="01:06.750">ら</span><span begin="01:06.750" end="01:06.980">だ</span><span begin="01:06.980" end="01:07.130">っ</span><span begin="01:07.130" end="01:07.440">て</span><span begin="01:07.440" end="01:07.720">叫</span><span begin="01:07.820" end="01:08.140">ぶ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是这样的我们也会放声呐喊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使是這樣的我們也會放聲吶喊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even people like us shout out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이런 우리라도 소리칠 테니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même des gens comme nous savent hurler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso personas como nosotros gritan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar solche wie wir schreien auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até garotas como nós gritam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже такие как мы будут кричать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche noi così gridiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna bokura datte sakebu</span></p>
      <p begin="01:08.160" end="01:09.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:08.160" end="01:08.250">見</span><span begin="01:08.250" end="01:08.450">せ</span><span begin="01:08.450" end="01:08.530">つ</span><span begin="01:08.530" end="01:08.700">け</span><span begin="01:08.700" end="01:08.780">て</span><span begin="01:08.870" end="01:09.180">こ</span><span begin="01:09.180" end="01:09.210">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p>
      <p begin="01:09.180" end="01:11.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:09.180" end="01:09.580">ラ</span><span begin="01:09.580" end="01:09.950">ラ</span><span begin="01:09.950" end="01:10.300">ラ</span><span begin="01:10.300" end="01:10.650">ラ</span><span begin="01:10.650" end="01:10.990">ラ</span><span begin="01:10.990" end="01:11.360">ラ</span><span begin="01:11.360" end="01:11.650">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:11.680" end="01:13.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:11.680" end="01:11.800">で</span><span begin="01:11.800" end="01:11.890">ん</span><span begin="01:11.890" end="01:11.960">ぐ</span><span begin="01:11.960" end="01:12.060">り</span><span begin="01:12.060" end="01:12.210">返</span><span begin="01:12.210" end="01:12.410">し</span> <span begin="01:12.410" end="01:12.500">で</span><span begin="01:12.500" end="01:12.590">ん</span><span begin="01:12.590" end="01:12.660">ぐ</span><span begin="01:12.660" end="01:12.760">り</span><span begin="01:12.760" end="01:12.930">返</span><span begin="01:12.930" end="01:13.100">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">翻个跟头 翻个跟头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">翻個跟頭 翻個跟頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Somersault somersault</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엎치락뒤치락 엎치락뒤치락</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faisons des culbutes des culbutes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dando volteretas dando volteretas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Purzelbaum Purzelbaum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dando cambalhotas dando cambalhotas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кувырок кувырок</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Capriole capriole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dengurigaeshi dengurigaeshi</span></p>
      <p begin="01:13.100" end="01:14.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:13.100" end="01:13.280">ラ</span><span begin="01:13.280" end="01:13.460">イ</span><span begin="01:13.460" end="01:13.650">ラ</span><span begin="01:13.650" end="01:13.810">イ</span><span begin="01:13.810" end="01:14.310">ラ</span><span begin="01:14.310" end="01:14.410">イ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来来来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">來來來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lie lie lie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라이라이라이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mensonge mensonge mensonge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Rai rai rai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lai-lai-lai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Rai-rai-rai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Рай-рай-рай</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lai lai lai</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rai rai rai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:25.790" end="01:28.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:25.790" end="01:26.470">ああ</span><span begin="01:26.470" end="01:26.500">、</span><span begin="01:26.840" end="01:27.260">君</span><span begin="01:27.370" end="01:27.630">が</span><span begin="01:27.760" end="01:27.960">言</span><span begin="01:27.960" end="01:28.300">う</span><span begin="01:28.300" end="01:28.460">な</span><span begin="01:28.460" end="01:28.570">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 如果是你这么说的话</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊啊 如果是你這麼說的話</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah, if you say so</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 네가 그렇게 말한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah si c'est toi qui le dis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah si tú lo dices</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah wenn du das sagst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah se é você quem está dizendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах раз уж ты так говоришь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah se lo dici tu</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, kimi ga iu nara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:28.640" end="01:31.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:28.640" end="01:28.820">な</span><span begin="01:28.820" end="01:29.000">ん</span><span begin="01:29.000" end="01:29.170">だ</span><span begin="01:29.170" end="01:29.340">か</span><span begin="01:29.340" end="01:29.710">頑</span><span begin="01:29.710" end="01:29.880">張</span><span begin="01:29.880" end="01:30.060">れ</span><span begin="01:30.210" end="01:30.580">ちゃ</span><span begin="01:30.580" end="01:30.750">う</span><span begin="01:30.750" end="01:31.160">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总觉得就能努力下去了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">總覺得就能努力下去了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I feel like I can somehow do my best</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">왠지 모르게 힘이 나잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J'ai l'impression de pouvoir faire de mon mieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De alguna manera puedo esforzarme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann ich mich irgendwie doch noch anstrengen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto que consigo me esforçar um pouco mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я почему-то полна решимости</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In qualche modo trovo la forza di impegnarmi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nandaka ganbarechau ya</span></p>
      <p begin="01:31.450" end="01:34.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:31.450" end="01:32.160">あ</span><span begin="01:32.160" end="01:32.340">あ</span><span begin="01:32.340" end="01:32.370">、</span><span begin="01:32.510" end="01:32.640">不</span><span begin="01:32.640" end="01:32.890">思</span><span begin="01:33.030" end="01:33.240">議</span><span begin="01:33.410" end="01:33.660">な</span><span begin="01:33.760" end="01:33.840">も</span><span begin="01:33.840" end="01:33.920">ん</span><span begin="01:33.920" end="01:34.100">だ</span><span begin="01:34.100" end="01:34.160">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 真是不可思议呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊啊 真是不可思議呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah, it's a mysterious thing isn't it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 참 신기한 일이지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah c'est vraiment étrange n'est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah es algo extraño verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah es ist schon ein Wunder nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah é uma coisa misteriosa não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах как же это удивительно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah è una cosa strana</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, fushigi na mon da ne</span></p>
      <p begin="01:34.240" end="01:35.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:34.240" end="01:34.590">青</span><span begin="01:34.590" end="01:34.890">春</span><span begin="01:34.980" end="01:35.170">ア</span><span begin="01:35.170" end="01:35.270">ディ</span><span begin="01:35.380" end="01:35.500">ク</span><span begin="01:35.500" end="01:35.850">ション</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青春真让人欲罢不能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">青春真讓人欲罷不能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Youth addiction</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끊을 수 없는 청춘이란 중독</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L'addiction à la jeunesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Adicción a la juventud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jugend-Sucht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse vício pela juventude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Юношеская зависимость</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dipendenza da giovinezza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Seishun adikushon</span></p>
