      <p begin="01:41.850" end="01:45.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:41.850" end="01:42.410">君</span><span begin="01:42.410" end="01:42.550">の</span><span begin="01:42.550" end="01:43.370">頭</span><span begin="01:43.450" end="01:43.710">に</span><span begin="01:43.810" end="01:44.360">流</span><span begin="01:44.360" end="01:44.520">れ</span><span begin="01:44.690" end="01:45.050">て</span><span begin="01:45.050" end="01:45.210">る</span><span begin="01:45.210" end="01:45.460">音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你脑海里流淌的旋律</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你腦海裡流淌的旋律</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The sound flowing in your head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네 머릿속에 흐르는 그 선율</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les sons qui résonnent dans ta tête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El sonido que fluye en tu cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Klang der in deinem Kopf fließt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O som que está fluindo na sua cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Звук что играет в твоей голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il suono che scorre nella tua testa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi no atama ni nagareteru oto</span></p>
      <p begin="01:45.520" end="01:49.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:45.520" end="01:45.740">そ</span><span begin="01:45.740" end="01:45.840">れ</span><span begin="01:45.840" end="01:45.930">が</span><span begin="01:45.930" end="01:46.150">僕</span><span begin="01:46.150" end="01:46.280">に</span><span begin="01:46.280" end="01:46.360">と</span><span begin="01:46.360" end="01:46.450">っ</span><span begin="01:46.450" end="01:46.570">て</span><span begin="01:46.770" end="01:46.890">の</span><span begin="01:47.000" end="01:47.240">モ</span><span begin="01:47.340" end="01:47.710">チ</span><span begin="01:47.710" end="01:47.970">ベー</span><span begin="01:48.050" end="01:48.510">ショ</span><span begin="01:48.510" end="01:49.340">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是我最大的前行动力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就是我最大的前行動力</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That is the motivation for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것이 나를 움직이는 원동력이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sont pour moi ma plus grande motivation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esa es mi motivación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist für mich die Motivation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Essa é a minha maior motivação</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это и есть моя мотивация</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quella è la mia motivazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ga boku ni totte no mochibeeshon</span></p>
      <p begin="01:49.800" end="01:52.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:49.800" end="01:50.170">僕</span><span begin="01:50.170" end="01:50.350">ら</span><span begin="01:50.350" end="01:50.420">の</span><span begin="01:50.500" end="01:50.600">世</span><span begin="01:50.700" end="01:51.060">界</span><span begin="01:51.060" end="01:51.240">に</span><span begin="01:51.240" end="01:52.080">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我们的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在我們的世界裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In our world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 세상에는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans notre monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En nuestro mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Was wohl in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O que será que está nos esperando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что же ждёт нас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cosa ci attenderà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bokura no sekai ni wa</span></p>
      <p begin="01:52.470" end="01:56.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:52.470" end="01:52.810">何</span><span begin="01:52.810" end="01:52.920">が</span><span begin="01:53.000" end="01:53.190">待</span><span begin="01:53.190" end="01:53.330">っ</span><span begin="01:53.330" end="01:53.520">て</span><span begin="01:53.520" end="01:53.690">る</span><span begin="01:53.690" end="01:53.880">の</span><span begin="01:53.880" end="01:54.050">だ</span><span begin="01:54.050" end="01:55.080">ろ</span><span begin="01:55.080" end="01:56.350">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟有什么在等待着呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟有什麼在等待著呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What is waiting for us I wonder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무엇이 기다리고 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qu'est-ce qui nous attend au juste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué nos estará esperando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unserer Welt auf uns wartet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No nosso mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В нашем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nel nostro mondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani ga matteru no darou</span></p>
      <p begin="01:56.680" end="01:59.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:56.680" end="01:56.860">切</span><span begin="01:56.860" end="01:57.210">り</span><span begin="01:57.210" end="01:57.790">開</span><span begin="01:57.790" end="01:57.940">い</span><span begin="01:57.940" end="01:58.000">て</span><span begin="01:58.110" end="01:58.530">こ</span><span begin="01:58.530" end="01:59.230">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">劈开前路吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">劈開前路吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's carve it open</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">헤쳐 나아가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Traçons notre propre chemin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a abrirnos camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einen Weg bahnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos abrir o caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай проложим себе путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Apriamo la nostra strada</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kirihiraite kou</span></p>
      <p begin="01:59.660" end="02:02.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:59.660" end="01:59.840">こ</span><span begin="01:59.840" end="01:59.970">ん</span><span begin="01:59.970" end="02:00.210">が</span><span begin="02:00.210" end="02:00.300">ら</span><span begin="02:00.380" end="02:00.580">が</span><span begin="02:00.580" end="02:00.670">っ</span><span begin="02:00.670" end="02:00.930">た</span><span begin="02:00.930" end="02:01.000">ま</span><span begin="02:01.110" end="02:01.330">ま</span><span begin="02:01.440" end="02:01.660">で</span><span begin="02:01.660" end="02:01.720">い</span><span begin="02:01.810" end="02:02.130">こう</span><span begin="02:02.130" end="02:02.400">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样保持着一团糟继续前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣保持著一團糟繼續前進吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's just go while staying all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엉망진창인 채로 나아가자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avançons même en restant tout emmêlés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigamos adelante así todos enredados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einfach so völlig verheddert weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos continuar assim todas emaranhadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай продолжим прямо в этой путанице</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andiamo avanti anche se siamo tutti aggrovigliati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kongaragatta mama de ikou ze</span></p>
      <p begin="02:02.660" end="02:04.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:02.660" end="02:02.930">君</span><span begin="02:03.030" end="02:03.220">と</span><span begin="02:03.220" end="02:03.280">行</span><span begin="02:03.370" end="02:03.450">け</span><span begin="02:03.560" end="02:03.770">た</span><span begin="02:03.770" end="02:03.900">ら</span><span begin="02:03.900" end="02:04.240">超</span><span begin="02:04.240" end="02:04.500">さ</span><span begin="02:04.500" end="02:04.620">い</span><span begin="02:04.620" end="02:04.960">こー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果能和你同行那真是最棒了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果能和你同行那真是最棒了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It would be super awesome if I could go with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너와 함께 간다면 더할 나위 없지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce serait super génial de pouvoir y aller avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sería súper genial si pudiera ir contigo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich mit dir gehen könnte wäre das absolut genial</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ir com você seria super demais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пойти вместе с тобой было бы просто супер</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se vado insieme a te è il massimo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi to iketara chou saikoo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:05.150" end="02:07.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:05.150" end="02:05.240">理</span><span begin="02:05.320" end="02:05.500">解</span><span begin="02:05.500" end="02:05.610">っ</span><span begin="02:05.610" end="02:05.840">て</span><span begin="02:05.840" end="02:06.040">も</span><span begin="02:06.040" end="02:06.190">ら</span><span begin="02:06.190" end="02:06.310">え</span><span begin="02:06.310" end="02:06.480">な</span><span begin="02:06.480" end="02:06.570">い</span><span begin="02:06.570" end="02:06.740">な</span><span begin="02:06.740" end="02:07.060">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然無法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they won't understand us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해받지 못한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S'ils ne peuvent pas nous comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no pueden entendernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie uns schon nicht verstehen wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eles não conseguem nos entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если они не хотят нас понимать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non riusciamo a farci capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatte moraenai nara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:07.240" end="02:09.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:07.240" end="02:07.330">ひ</span><span begin="02:07.450" end="02:07.590">た</span><span begin="02:07.590" end="02:07.790">す</span><span begin="02:07.790" end="02:08.010">ら</span><span begin="02:08.010" end="02:08.160">に</span><span begin="02:08.160" end="02:08.450">挑</span><span begin="02:08.450" end="02:08.530">ん</span><span begin="02:08.530" end="02:08.590">で</span><span begin="02:08.590" end="02:08.680">ゆ</span><span begin="02:08.680" end="02:08.870">く</span><span begin="02:08.870" end="02:09.210">物</span><span begin="02:09.210" end="02:09.890">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就演绎一场不断发起挑战的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就演繹一場不斷發起挑戰的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story of relentlessly taking on challenges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 끝없이 부딪혀가는 이야기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C'est l'histoire d'un défi que nous relèverons sans relâche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es una historia de desafiar constantemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Geschichte die einfach unerbittlich herausfordert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então esta é uma história onde apenas continuamos desafiando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это история нашего неустанного вызова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una storia in cui continueremo a sfidare tutto ciecamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitasura ni idonde yuku monogatari</span></p>
      <p begin="02:10.230" end="02:11.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:10.230" end="02:10.350">見</span><span begin="02:10.350" end="02:10.560">せ</span><span begin="02:10.560" end="02:10.640">つ</span><span begin="02:10.640" end="02:10.830">け</span><span begin="02:10.830" end="02:10.900">て</span><span begin="02:10.980" end="02:11.290">こ</span><span begin="02:11.290" end="02:11.320">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p>
      <p begin="02:11.300" end="02:13.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:11.300" end="02:11.680">ラ</span><span begin="02:11.680" end="02:12.070">ラ</span><span begin="02:12.070" end="02:12.430">ラ</span><span begin="02:12.430" end="02:12.770">ラ</span><span begin="02:12.770" end="02:13.120">ラ</span><span begin="02:13.120" end="02:13.480">ラ</span><span begin="02:13.480" end="02:13.760">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:13.790" end="02:15.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:13.790" end="02:13.950">た</span><span begin="02:13.950" end="02:14.070">ま</span><span begin="02:14.070" end="02:14.180">にゃ</span><span begin="02:14.180" end="02:14.390">僕</span><span begin="02:14.390" end="02:14.520">ら</span><span begin="02:14.520" end="02:14.730">だ</span><span begin="02:14.730" end="02:14.890">っ</span><span begin="02:14.890" end="02:15.070">て</span><span begin="02:15.230" end="02:15.480">嘆</span><span begin="02:15.570" end="02:15.890">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔我们也会发发牢骚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">偶爾我們也會發發牢騷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Sometimes even people like us lament</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가끔은 우리도 한숨 쉬겠지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parfois même des gens comme nous se lamentent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De vez en cuando nosotros también nos lamentamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Manchmal klagen auch solche wie wir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Às vezes até garotas como nós lamentam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Иногда даже мы сокрушаемся</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A volte anche noi ci lamentiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tamanya bokura datte nageku</span></p>
      <p begin="02:15.920" end="02:16.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:15.920" end="02:16.000">見</span><span begin="02:16.000" end="02:16.220">せ</span><span begin="02:16.220" end="02:16.280">つ</span><span begin="02:16.280" end="02:16.470">け</span><span begin="02:16.470" end="02:16.530">て</span><span begin="02:16.620" end="02:16.880">こ</span><span begin="02:16.880" end="02:16.910">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p>
      <p begin="02:16.950" end="02:19.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:16.950" end="02:17.340">ラ</span><span begin="02:17.340" end="02:17.720">ラ</span><span begin="02:17.720" end="02:18.070">ラ</span><span begin="02:18.070" end="02:18.440">ラ</span><span begin="02:18.440" end="02:18.760">ラ</span><span begin="02:18.760" end="02:19.120">ラ</span><span begin="02:19.120" end="02:19.370">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
