      <p begin="02:42.360" end="02:44.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:42.360" end="02:42.740">ラ</span><span begin="02:42.740" end="02:43.120">ラ</span><span begin="02:43.120" end="02:43.470">ラ</span><span begin="02:43.470" end="02:43.830">ラ</span><span begin="02:43.830" end="02:44.180">ラ</span><span begin="02:44.180" end="02:44.560">ラ</span><span begin="02:44.560" end="02:44.860">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:49.080" end="02:50.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="02:49.080" end="02:49.150">無</span><span begin="02:49.260" end="02:49.620">敵</span><span begin="02:49.620" end="02:49.680">の</span><span begin="02:49.770" end="02:50.120">シー</span><span begin="02:50.120" end="02:50.190">ク</span><span begin="02:50.190" end="02:50.410">レ</span><span begin="02:50.410" end="02:50.490">ッ</span><span begin="02:50.490" end="02:50.530">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无敌的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無敵的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">An invincible secret</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무적의 비밀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un secret invincible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un secreto invencible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein unbesiegbares Geheimnis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um segredo invencível</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Непобедимый секрет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un segreto invincibile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Muteki no shiikuretto</span></p>
      <p begin="02:51.880" end="02:54.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="02:51.880" end="02:52.060">こ</span><span begin="02:52.060" end="02:52.200">ん</span><span begin="02:52.200" end="02:52.480">が</span><span begin="02:52.480" end="02:52.610">ら</span><span begin="02:52.610" end="02:52.820">が</span><span begin="02:52.820" end="02:52.900">っ</span><span begin="02:52.900" end="02:53.070">た</span><span begin="02:53.160" end="02:53.240">ま</span><span begin="02:53.350" end="02:53.570">ま</span><span begin="02:53.700" end="02:53.880">で</span><span begin="02:53.880" end="02:53.940">い</span><span begin="02:54.040" end="02:54.290">こう</span><span begin="02:54.380" end="02:54.650">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样保持着一团糟继续前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣保持著一團糟繼續前進吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's just go while staying all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엉망진창인 채로 나아가자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avançons même en restant tout emmêlés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigamos adelante así todos enredados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einfach so völlig verheddert weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos continuar assim todas emaranhadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай продолжим прямо в этой путанице</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andiamo avanti anche se siamo tutti aggrovigliati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kongaragatta mama de ikou ze</span></p>
      <p begin="02:54.900" end="02:57.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="02:54.900" end="02:55.260">思</span><span begin="02:55.260" end="02:55.330">い</span><span begin="02:55.430" end="02:55.630">込</span><span begin="02:55.630" end="02:55.770">み</span><span begin="02:55.770" end="02:55.950">さ</span><span begin="02:55.950" end="02:56.170">え</span><span begin="02:56.170" end="02:56.480">も</span><span begin="02:56.480" end="02:56.850">才</span><span begin="02:56.850" end="02:57.140">能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连一厢情愿也是种天赋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連一廂情願也是種天賦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even having fixed ideas is a talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멋대로 믿는 것조차 재능이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même nos convictions aveugles sont un talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso creer ciegamente es un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar reine Einbildung ist ein Talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até mesmo criar ilusões é um talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже слепая вера это талант</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persino le nostre fisse sono un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omoikomi sae mo sainou</span></p>
      <p begin="02:57.380" end="02:59.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="02:57.380" end="02:57.480">理</span><span begin="02:57.560" end="02:57.750">解</span><span begin="02:57.750" end="02:57.840">っ</span><span begin="02:57.840" end="02:58.070">て</span><span begin="02:58.070" end="02:58.260">も</span><span begin="02:58.260" end="02:58.420">ら</span><span begin="02:58.420" end="02:58.540">え</span><span begin="02:58.540" end="02:58.710">な</span><span begin="02:58.710" end="02:58.800">い</span><span begin="02:58.800" end="02:58.890">な</span><span begin="02:58.970" end="02:59.320">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然無法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they won't understand us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해받지 못한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S'ils ne peuvent pas nous comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no pueden entendernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie uns schon nicht verstehen wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eles não conseguem nos entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если они не хотят нас понимать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non riusciamo a farci capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatte moraenai nara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:59.510" end="03:02.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56"><span begin="02:59.510" end="02:59.590">ひ</span><span begin="02:59.680" end="02:59.810">た</span><span begin="02:59.810" end="03:00.040">す</span><span begin="03:00.040" end="03:00.240">ら</span><span begin="03:00.240" end="03:00.330">に</span><span begin="03:00.410" end="03:00.650">挑</span><span begin="03:00.650" end="03:00.750">ん</span><span begin="03:00.750" end="03:00.820">で</span><span begin="03:00.820" end="03:00.900">ゆ</span><span begin="03:00.900" end="03:01.110">く</span><span begin="03:01.110" end="03:01.450">物</span><span begin="03:01.450" end="03:02.170">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就演绎一场不断发起挑战的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就演繹一場不斷發起挑戰的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story of relentlessly taking on challenges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 끝없이 부딪혀가는 이야기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C'est l'histoire d'un défi que nous relèverons sans relâche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es una historia de desafiar constantemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Geschichte die einfach unerbittlich herausfordert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então esta é uma história onde apenas continuamos desafiando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это история нашего неустанного вызова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una storia in cui continueremo a sfidare tutto ciecamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitasura ni idonde yuku monogatari</span></p>
      <p begin="03:02.480" end="03:03.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57"><span begin="03:02.480" end="03:02.570">見</span><span begin="03:02.570" end="03:02.790">せ</span><span begin="03:02.790" end="03:02.870">つ</span><span begin="03:02.870" end="03:03.050">け</span><span begin="03:03.050" end="03:03.120">て</span><span begin="03:03.210" end="03:03.520">こ</span><span begin="03:03.520" end="03:03.550">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.540" end="03:06.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58"><span begin="03:03.540" end="03:03.940">ラ</span><span begin="03:03.940" end="03:04.300">ラ</span><span begin="03:04.300" end="03:04.650">ラ</span><span begin="03:04.650" end="03:05.010">ラ</span><span begin="03:05.010" end="03:05.360">ラ</span><span begin="03:05.360" end="03:05.730">ラ</span><span begin="03:05.730" end="03:06.000">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
      <p begin="03:06.020" end="03:08.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59"><span begin="03:06.020" end="03:06.230">こ</span><span begin="03:06.230" end="03:06.300">ん</span><span begin="03:06.300" end="03:06.400">な</span><span begin="03:06.400" end="03:06.600">僕</span><span begin="03:06.600" end="03:06.760">ら</span><span begin="03:06.760" end="03:07.000">だ</span><span begin="03:07.000" end="03:07.110">っ</span><span begin="03:07.110" end="03:07.430">て</span><span begin="03:07.430" end="03:07.720">叫</span><span begin="03:07.810" end="03:08.110">ぶ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是这样的我们也会放声呐喊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使是這樣的我們也會放聲吶喊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even people like us shout out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이런 우리라도 소리칠 테니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même des gens comme nous savent hurler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso personas como nosotros gritan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar solche wie wir schreien auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até garotas como nós gritam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже такие как мы будут кричать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche noi così gridiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna bokura datte sakebu</span></p>
      <p begin="03:08.150" end="03:09.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60"><span begin="03:08.150" end="03:08.230">見</span><span begin="03:08.230" end="03:08.440">せ</span><span begin="03:08.440" end="03:08.520">つ</span><span begin="03:08.520" end="03:08.700">け</span><span begin="03:08.700" end="03:08.760">て</span><span begin="03:08.860" end="03:09.170">こ</span><span begin="03:09.170" end="03:09.200">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p>
      <p begin="03:09.180" end="03:11.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61"><span begin="03:09.180" end="03:09.580">ラ</span><span begin="03:09.580" end="03:09.940">ラ</span><span begin="03:09.940" end="03:10.310">ラ</span><span begin="03:10.310" end="03:10.640">ラ</span><span begin="03:10.640" end="03:10.990">ラ</span><span begin="03:10.990" end="03:11.370">ラ</span><span begin="03:11.370" end="03:11.630">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p>
      <p begin="03:11.670" end="03:13.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62"><span begin="03:11.670" end="03:11.800">で</span><span begin="03:11.800" end="03:11.870">ん</span><span begin="03:11.870" end="03:11.960">ぐ</span><span begin="03:11.960" end="03:12.070">り</span><span begin="03:12.070" end="03:12.220">返</span><span begin="03:12.220" end="03:12.400">し</span> <span begin="03:12.400" end="03:12.500">で</span><span begin="03:12.500" end="03:12.580">ん</span><span begin="03:12.580" end="03:12.670">ぐ</span><span begin="03:12.670" end="03:12.750">り</span><span begin="03:12.750" end="03:12.920">返</span><span begin="03:12.920" end="03:13.060">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">翻个跟头 翻个跟头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">翻個跟頭 翻個跟頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Somersault somersault</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엎치락뒤치락 엎치락뒤치락</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faisons des culbutes des culbutes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dando volteretas dando volteretas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Purzelbaum Purzelbaum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dando cambalhotas dando cambalhotas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кувырок кувырок</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Capriole capriole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dengurigaeshi dengurigaeshi</span></p>
